  Timestamps: "0.063\n3.066\n4.768\n5.936\n10.273\n11.808\n12.909\n14.444\n19.716\n22.419\n24.521\n30.494\n33.43\n41.772\n43.874\n47.377\n55.585\n56.753\n62.259\n63.16\n64.528\n66.93\n73.036"
  WrittenDialogue: "Ah, I see you’ve made it quite far.\nAre you surprised or something?\nWhy would I be?\nCause your weird little henchman kept calling me stupid. And I beat his ass!\nIt’s not a competition.\nIt literally is.\nRight of course.\nAnd just because I’m really beautiful everybody I play assumes I’m stupid, and I still win.\nThe puzzle’s not a metric of intelligence.\nI thought it tested “logic and wit”?\nThose were the first words that came to mind. I don’t know precisely what it takes to beat these puzzles.\nSo you don’t need to be smart to do them?    \nCan the world record holder in Pac-Man fix the economy?  Or can the greatest StarCraft player lead the military in war?\n...What the fuck is StarCraft?\nMy point exactly... almost, anyway.\nThese puzzles are a game, a specialized interest. You could be the greatest in the world, but what would that really get you?\nMy phone unlocked.\nOther than that- If you willfully played it, {1}what would that get you?\nNothing?\nYou said it, not me.\nSo why are you forcing me to play this??\nAsk again later.  Enough talk, why don’t we truly test how good you are?"
  DialogueCharacterNames: "THE PUZZLER\nJECKA\nTHE PUZZLER\nJECKA\nTHE PUZZLER\nJECKA\nTHE PUZZLER\nJECKA\nTHE PUZZLER\nJECKA\nTHE PUZZLER\nJECKA\nTHE PUZZLER\nJECKA\nTHE PUZZLER\nTHE PUZZLER\nJECKA\nTHE PUZZLER\nJECKA\nTHE PUZZLER\nJECKA\nTHE PUZZLER"
